# `a[i & 7]` asks in the turn whether 7 lies below the length and narrows the length behind that question. `a[(i + 1) & 7]` meets the same question answered: no block begins there, and the length was
# narrowed again where the read stood, behind other operations of its block: the verifier stopped the build under check=Validate and in every build with assertions.
